@@ -105,6 +105,10 @@ The format of this change log follows the advice given at [Keep a CHANGELOG](htt
 
 #### Changed
 
+- The `newlogin` message provider (New login notifications) is now forced on (`MESSAGE_FORCED`) by default for the `popup`, `email` and `airnotifier` outputs on new installs. A new security check, `\core\check\security\newloginnotifications`, warns administrators when new login notifications are not forced on.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-89465](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-89465)
+
 - The `search` landmark role in the `core/search_input_auto` template is enclosed within a `searchrole` Mustache block so that templates that use this template can override and remove the `search` landmark role when deemed unnecessary.
 
   For more information see [MDL-88833](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-88833)
